000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CVALRCVR.
000400 AUTHOR.              BARBARA WINTER.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        NOVEMBER 1986.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM PERFORMS SEVERAL FUNCTIONS:
001000*             1.  DETERMINES IF PO IS A NON-RECEIVABLE PO
001100*             2.  DETERMINES PO TYPE FOR KELLY (BLANKET, ETC)
001200*             3.  DETERMINES IF "PAY UPON RECEIPT" VENDOR
001300*             4.  VALIDATES AKRON USERS AGAINST PO RECEIVING DEPT
001400*             5.  RETRIEVES AKRON PRINT DEPARTMENT.
001500*
      ****************************************************************
      *C 06/06/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXTEND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP FILE FORMAT CHANGES.
      ****************************************************************
001600 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001700 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001800 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001900 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

            SELECT DPORECD
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS DPORECD-STATUS.
002000 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DPORECD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0900  OF MCFLCS0901.

002100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  DPORECD-STATUS             PIC X(2).
002200 01  PLANT-VALUE                PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
002300 01  DETERMINE-PLANT REDEFINES PLANT-VALUE.
002400     05  PLANT-NUM              PIC X(2).
002500         88  AKRON                     VALUE "11".
002600     05  FILLER                 PIC X.
002700
002800 01  WS-ENTIRE-ZBILL.
002900     05  FILLER                 PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
003000     05  WS-ZBILL               PIC X(5)   VALUE SPACES.
003500
003510 COPY DBPOARG2 OF COPYLIB.
003520
003600 COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.
003700 01  CODE-ARG                   PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
003800 01  PO-SEARCH                  PIC X(10) VALUE "PO-RCV-NO;".
003900 01  VEN-CODE-SEARCH            PIC X(10) VALUE "VEN-CODE;".
004000 01  ALL-ITEM-LIST              PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
004400 COPY DBMODES OF COPYLIB.
004500 COPY DBSTAT  OF COPYLIB.
004600**************************************************************
004700**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
004800**************************************************************
004900 LINKAGE SECTION.
005000 COPY DOCKMISC OF COPYLIB.
005100*----------  VALID USER DEPARTMENTS FOR AKRON
005200 01  USER-AREA                  PIC X(2400).
005300 01  USER-AREA-RD REDEFINES USER-AREA.
005400     02  USER-DATA OCCURS 200 TIMES INDEXED BY I.
005500         03  USER-NAME-UA       PIC X(8).
005600         03  RCV-DPT-UA         PIC X(4).
005700 01  CVR-MESSAGE-BUFFER.
005800     05  MSG-BUFFER             PIC X(68).
005900     05  MSG-VALUE              PIC X(4).
006000 01  LANG-SETNUM                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
006100 01  LANG-MSGNUM                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
006200 COPY DPORECD OF COPYLIB.
006300 01  CVR-FILLER                 PIC X(10).
006400
006500 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING MISCELLANEOUS-DATA, USER-AREA,
006600                          CVR-MESSAGE-BUFFER,
006700                          LANG-SETNUM, LANG-MSGNUM,
006800                          BUF-DPORECD, CVR-FILLER.
006900 00-CVALRCVR-MAIN.
           OPEN I-O DPORECD.
006910     MOVE ZEROES                 TO LANG-SETNUM,
006920                                    LANG-MSGNUM.
006930     MOVE SPACES                 TO CVR-MESSAGE-BUFFER.
007000     MOVE PLT-NUMBER             TO PLANT-VALUE.
007010     MOVE MISC-RS-ARG            TO WS-ACCUMULATOR.
007020     MOVE "000"                  TO WS-ACCUM-RS.
007100
007200     PERFORM 600-VALIDATE-RECEIVER THRU 699-EXIT.
007300
           CLOSE DPORECD.
008600     GOBACK.
008700
008800 600-VALIDATE-RECEIVER.
008900
009000*----------  RETRIEVE PO RECORD
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR TO PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC.
           START DPORECD KEY = EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY INVALID KEY
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
009300     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
009400           MOVE "DBFIND DPORECD 600 CVALRCVR " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
009500           MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
009600           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DPORECD NEXT INTO BUF-DPORECD AT END
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF PORCVNO OF DPORECD-REC NOT = WS-ACCUMULATOR
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
009900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
010000           MOVE "DBGET DPORECD 600 CVALRCVR  " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
010100           MOVE WS-ACCUMULATOR              TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
010200           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
010300
010400*-----------  CANNOT RECEIVE ON A NON-RECEIVABLE PO (SERVICES,ETC)
010500     IF PO-NON-RCV-INDIC NOT = " "
010600*       "CANNOT RECEIVE-THIS IS A NON-RECEIVABLE PO"
010700        MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM
010800        MOVE  12 TO LANG-MSGNUM
010900        GO TO 699-EXIT.
011000
011100     MOVE PO-ZBILL                        TO  WS-ENTIRE-ZBILL.
011200     MOVE WS-ZBILL                        TO  MISC-ZBILL.
011300     MOVE PO-MULTI-ZBILL                  TO  MISC-MULTIZ.
011400     MOVE PO-FOB                          TO  MISC-PO-FOB.
011500     MOVE PO-VIA                          TO  MISC-PO-VIA.
011600     MOVE PO-VEN-CODE                     TO  MISC-VEN-CODE.
011700
011800*----------  KELLY:  PASS PO INDICATOR FOR RAW MATERIALS, BUT IF PO
011900*            IS A BLANKET ORDER LET THAT OVERRIDE SINCE THERE ARE
012000*            NO OVERSHIPMENT CHECKS FOR BLANKETS.
012100     MOVE PO-TYPE TO KELLY-PO-IND.
012200     IF PO-BLANKET-INDIC = "B" OR PO-BLANKET-INDIC = "Y"
012300        MOVE "B" TO KELLY-PO-IND.
012400
012500*----------  CHECK IF VENDOR SHOULD BE PAID UPON RECEIP          T
012600*            WITHOUT AN INVOICE.  (FLAG IN DPORECD)
           IF PO-INVOICELESS-IND NOT = " "
015400        MOVE "Y" TO VENDOR-SW
015500     ELSE
015600        MOVE "N" TO VENDOR-SW.
015700
012800     IF NOT AKRON
012900        GO TO 699-EXIT.
015800 665-VALID-RCV-DPT.
015900*----------  IF AKRON PLANTS, CHECK FOR VALID RECEIVING DOCKS.
016000*----------  TWO EXCEPTION USERS ARE TRAINING AND MGR.
016100     IF MISC-USER-NAME = "DOCKX   "
016200        MOVE "TRAN" TO PRINT-DEPT
016300        GO TO 699-EXIT.
016400     IF MISC-USER-NAME = "MGR     "
016500        MOVE "119B" TO PRINT-DEPT
016600        GO TO 699-EXIT.
016700
016710*----------  ALLOW MATERIAL CONTROL USERS TO CORRECT ANYTHING
016720     IF MISC-USER-NAME = "MATCONT " OR "MATCONT2" OR "MATCONT3"
016730                    OR   "MIXCTR  " OR "MATCONT5" OR "MATCONT8"
016740                    OR   "MATCONT9" OR "MATCONTX"
016750         GO TO 699-EXIT.
016800
016900*----------  FIND USER IN TABLE AND MATCH RECEIVING DEPARTMENTS.
017000*            IF NOT FOUND, THE USER CANNOT CREATE THIS
017100*            RECEIVING SLIP.
017200     SET I                  TO 1.
017300     SEARCH USER-DATA
017400          AT END GO TO 690-INVALID-USER
017500          WHEN USER-NAME-UA (I) = MISC-USER-NAME AND
017600               RCV-DPT-UA (I) = PO-RCV-DEPT
017700          MOVE RCV-DPT-UA (I) TO PRINT-DEPT
017800          GO TO 699-EXIT.
017900 690-INVALID-USER.
018000     MOVE PO-RCV-DEPT    TO  MSG-VALUE.
018100*    "YOU ARE NOT AUTHORIZED TO RECEIVE THIS SHIPMENT"
018200     MOVE  25 TO LANG-SETNUM
018300     MOVE   1 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
018400 699-EXIT.  EXIT.
018500
018600 990-BLOWUP.
018700     MOVE "CVALRCVR"            TO BU-PGM-NAME.
018800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
018900           DUMMY-VIEW-AREA, DPORECD-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
019000           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
019100 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
